  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project
  package-lock.json,project
  package.json,project
  scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts,project
  test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "npm run release:check",project,fleet-wave-script,"2026-09-25T08:42:38.214Z",local_mutation,certify-pm-cli-2026-9-23-and-roll-out-guarded-merge-driver-launcher
close_reason: "Pins: @babel/core ^8.0.5 -> ^8.0.6, @babel/eslint-parser ^8.0.5 -> ^8.0.6, @types/node ^26.5.1 -> ^26.6.2, @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17 -> 2026.9.23, jscpd ^5.2.0 -> ^5.3.1, pm-changelog ^2026.9.16 -> 2026.9.23, pm-ops ^2026.9.13 -> 2026.9.23 (package.json and package-lock.json). Launcher: pm-ops template copied unchanged; test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts proves byte identity and exercises every launcher branch in isolated checkouts. Absorbs Dependabot #72-#77 (babel 8.0.6, @types/node 26.6.2, jscpd 5.3.1, pm-cli pin, and the codeql-action group, which cannot pass the self-host gate on its own). Removes the unit tests of the vendored launcher's internals from test/quality-scripts.test.ts (now tested in pm-ops), and regenerates selfhost.bundle last so the self-host gate proves the committed tree. The CI health block runs green with --require-merge-drivers; release:check exits 0."
body: ""
